# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in. Never commit real values, and never put them in dev.env (that file is tracked).

# PayPal donations (server-browser/src/donations). Read only by the lobby, from the environment; the client secret
# never reaches the browser. Empty: donations are off and the support page says so.
# PAYPAL_ENV: sandbox (test money; dev machines only take this) or live (real money; production only takes this).
PAYPAL_ENV=
PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=
PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET=
